{"task_id": "HumanEval/39", "solution": "def _is_prime(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given number is prime.\"\"\"\n    if num < 2:\n        return False\n    if num == 2:\n        return True\n    if num % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= num:\n        if num % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True\ndef prime_fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    prime_fib returns n-th number that is a Fibonacci number and it's also prime.\n    >>> prime_fib(1)\n    2\n    >>> prime_fib(2)\n    3\n    >>> prime_fib(3)\n    5\n    >>> prime_fib(4)\n    13\n    >>> prime_fib(5)\n    89\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    fib_gen = _fibonacci_generator()\n    while True:\n        fib_num = next(fib_gen)\n        if _is_prime(fib_num):\n            count += 1\n            if count == n:\n                return fib_num"}
