{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the Fib4 number sequence efficiently using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize dynamic programming array with base cases\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    dp[1] = 0\n    dp[2] = 2\n    dp[3] = 0\n\n    # Iterate to compute fib4(i) for i from 4 to n\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2] + dp[i-3] + dp[i-4]\n\n    return dp[n]"}
